"|badge1| |badge2| |badge_fisa| |badge_tests|\n"
"\n"
"Adds the Point of Sale orders that were not invoiced to the sale margin\n"
"report (*Raport analiză profit*) of ``deltatech_sale_margin``. The\n"
"invoiced orders are already in the report through their invoice, so they\n"
"are not counted twice.\n"
"\n"
"For each order line the report shows:\n"
"\n"
"- the sale value without VAT, in the company currency; returns are\n"
"  negative;\n"
"- the cost of the line, as computed by the Point of Sale when the\n"
"  session is closed, or the current product cost while the session is\n"
"  still open;\n"
"- the salesperson of the order and the journal of the POS orders; with\n"
"  ``deltatech_sale_commission``, the computed commission uses the rates\n"
"  set on the **invoice journal** of the point of sale;\n"
"- the order itself, with a *POS Sales* filter and a grouping by order.\n"
"\n"
"The rows of the orders are read-only: the real commission, *Commission\n"
"Paid* and the purchase price are kept on the invoice lines only, and the\n"
"commission and cost wizards leave the orders out.\n"
"\n"
"The module is not installed automatically: it changes the figures of the\n"
"report.\n"
"\n"
"The credit note of a Point of Sale return invoiced for a receipt that\n"
"was not invoiced reverses no invoice, so it takes its cost from the\n"
"lines of the POS return (the cost of the original sale) instead of 0.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"Install the module on demand: it is not installed automatically, because\n"
"it changes the figures of the profit report.\n"
"\n"
"**Step 1 — Sell at the Point of Sale**\n"
"\n"
"Sell and take the payment as usual. In **Point of Sale → Orders →\n"
"Orders**, the order is *Paid* (or *Posted* after the session is closed),\n"
"without an invoice. Nothing else is needed: its lines go to the profit\n"
"report on their own.\n"
"\n"
"|Paid Point of Sale order without invoice|\n"
"\n"
"**Step 2 — See the POS sales in the profit report**\n"
"\n"
"Go to **Sales → Reporting → Profit Analysis** and group the pivot by\n"
"**Journal**, then by **Product**. The invoices are under the sales\n"
"journal, the uninvoiced POS orders under the journal of the point of\n"
"sale, with sale value (without VAT), cost and profit. An invoiced POS\n"
"order appears only once, through its invoice. A return has negative\n"
"quantity and values.\n"
"\n"
"While the session is open, the cost is the current product cost; once\n"
"the session is closed, it is the cost computed by the Point of Sale from\n"
"the delivery.\n"
"\n"
"|Profit report grouped by journal: invoices and POS|\n"
"\n"
"**Step 3 — Only the POS sales**\n"
"\n"
"In the list view, remove the default groupings and the date filter, and\n"
"choose the **POS Sales** filter (**Invoices** shows only the invoice\n"
"lines). The **POS Order** column shows the order of each row; group by\n"
"**POS Order** to sum the lines per order. The POS rows are read-only.\n"
"\n"
"With ``deltatech_sale_commission``, the POS rows also get the computed\n"
"commission of the salesperson of the order, from the rates set on the\n"
"**invoice journal** of the point of sale.\n"
"\n"
"|POS sales in the profit report|\n"
"\n"
"**Step 4 — Invoiced return of a receipt**\n"
"\n"
"When the customer returns goods bought with a receipt and asks for an\n"
"invoice on the return, the credit note reverses no invoice. The module\n"
"takes its cost from the Point of Sale return lines: the cost of the\n"
"original sale, in the unit of the invoice line. In the profit report,\n"
"the **Invoices** filter shows the credit note with negative quantity and\n"
"values, and a cost instead of 0. A credit note issued before this\n"
"version and left with a cost of 0 is corrected with the *Update Purchase\n"
"Price* wizard (select the lines in the list, then the **Action** menu).\n"
"\n"
"|Credit note of an invoiced POS return in the profit report|\n"
"\n"
".. |Paid Point of Sale order without invoice| image:: https://"
"apps.odoocdn.com/apps/assets/19.0/deltatech_sale_margin_pos/"
"01_bon_pos_nefacturat.png\n"
".. |Profit report grouped by journal: invoices and POS| image:: https://"
"apps.odoocdn.com/apps/assets/19.0/deltatech_sale_margin_pos/"
"02_raport_profit_pe_jurnal.png\n"
".. |POS sales in the profit report| image:: https://apps.odoocdn.com/apps/"
"assets/19.0/deltatech_sale_margin_pos/03_vanzari_pos_in_raport.png\n"
".. |Credit note of an invoiced POS return in the profit report| image:: "
"https://apps.odoocdn.com/apps/assets/19.0/deltatech_sale_margin_pos/"
"04_nota_credit_retur_pos.png\n"
"\n"
"Changelog\n"
"=========\n"
"\n"
"Changelog\n"
"=========\n"
"\n"
"19.0.1.1.0 (2026-11-18)\n"
"-----------------------\n"
"\n"
"- The credit note issued from a Point of Sale return of a receipt (the\n"
"  sale was not invoiced, so the credit note reverses no invoice) takes\n"
"  its cost from the Point of Sale: the cost of the returned goods, which\n"
"  is the cost of the original sale. Until now it had a cost of 0 and the\n"
"  *Profit analysis* report showed the whole value of the return as a\n"
"  loss. The cost of the lines already invoiced is corrected with the\n"
"  *Update Purchase Price* wizard.\n"
"\n"
"19.0.1.0.1 (2026-10-28)\n"
"-----------------------\n"
"\n"
"- The POS rows give the *Track Inventory* column of the product, used by\n"
"  the *Storable Products* filter of the report (on by default since\n"
"  ``deltatech_sale_margin`` 19.0.1.3.4); without it the POS sales of\n"
"  storable products were hidden by that filter.\n"
"- Consultant sheet: the *Storable Products* filter is removed in the\n"
"  steps that show the demo, whose products are not storable.\n"
"\n"
"19.0.1.0.0 (2026-10-22)\n"
"-----------------------\n"
"\n"
"- Point of Sale orders without an invoice in the sale margin report,\n"
"  with the cost computed at the closing of the session and, with the\n"
"  commissions, the rates of the point of sale journal.\n"
"\n"
"- Module icon (``icon.svg`` + ``icon.png``).\n"
"\n"
"- The commission rates of the POS orders are taken from the invoice\n"
"  journal of the point of sale: the rates accept only sales journals,\n"
"  and the journal of the POS orders is a miscellaneous one.\n"
"\n"
"- Consultant sheet, usage guide and screenshots.\n"
"\n"
